title: "Transport, Not Computation: A Cross-Model Falsification Program on How 1B-3B Language Models Use Long Context"
type: article
authors:
  - family-names: "Vyaltsev"
    given-names: "Evgenii"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-3712-6798"
  - family-names: "Vyaltsev"
